:name: mec172xmodular_assy6930
:description: This script is prepared to run Zephyr on a mec172xmodular_assy6930.

$name?="mec172xmodular_assy6930"

using sysbus
mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/mec17xmodular_assy6930.repl

showAnalyzer uart1
#cpu PerformanceInMips 4

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu0 VectorTableOffset `sysbus GetSymbolAddress "_vector_table"`
    cpu0 EnableZephyrMode
"""
runMacro $reset
